  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Investing in Young Businesses in Africa &amp;#8211; IYBA Invest</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;IYBA INVEST, implemented by FMO and I&amp;P, will consist of 3 main components:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Component 1: Strengthening IPDEV Partner Funds &amp;amp; Portfolio Companies (EUR 16 700 000) &#xbf;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot; class=&quot;ql-indent-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Financial Risk Capital (EUR 10 000 000 from the EU, EUR 3 000 000 from FMO MASSIF): A first-loss capital mechanism to de-risk investments and attract additional investors, including Development Finance Institutions and private investors.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot; class=&quot;ql-indent-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Technical Assistance (&#xbf;1.2M from the EU): Capacity-building support for IPDEV&#xbf;s 8 existing and 5-7 new partner funds, strengthening their investment teams and management practices. &#xbf; MSME Capacity Building (&#xbf;0.5M from the EU): Direct support for portfolio companies to enhance operational efficiency and business development.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot; class=&quot;ql-indent-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Management Cost (EUR 2 000 000 from the EU)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-indent-1&quot;&gt;This component will enable IPDEV 1) to support the 8 existing partner funds in raising capital for second and third investment cycles and 2) to launch 5 to 7 new funds in new frontier markets. The objective is to provide 20 to 40% of the capital and convince local private sector and institutions to invest in the fund. Additionally, up to 200 MSMEs are expected to benefit from this component through equity and debt investments provided by the locally managed partner funds.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Component 2: Pipeline Development &amp;amp; Acceleration of MSMEs (&#xbf;9.9M)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot; class=&quot;ql-indent-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Seed Funding (&#xbf;5M from the EU): A mix of repayable grants, low-interest loans, and convertible equity to help early-stage MSMEs develop their business models.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot; class=&quot;ql-indent-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Technical Assistance (&#xbf;3.9M from the EU): Customized business development services delivered by investment experts, consultants, and the Club Africain des Entrepreneurs.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot; class=&quot;ql-indent-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Management Cost (EUR 1 000 000 from the EU)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-indent-1&quot;&gt;This component will support 90 high-potential MSMEs, preparing them for later-stage equity investments and sustainable growth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Component 3: Ecosystem Building &amp;amp; Advocacy (&#xbf;400K from the EU) Recognizing the importance of a supportive entrepreneurial environment, IYBA INVEST funds:&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot; class=&quot;ql-indent-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Knowledge Sharing &amp;amp; Policy Advocacy: Research, case studies, and best practice dissemination to improve access to finance for MSMEs.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot; class=&quot;ql-indent-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Workshops &amp;amp; Stakeholder Engagement: Collaboration with local entrepreneurship support organizations (ESOs), financial institutions, and policymakers.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot; class=&quot;ql-indent-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Capacity Development for Ecosystem Players: Strengthening networks that connect MSMEs with investors, mentors, and technical advisors.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
